1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:06,017
Learn the ABCs with Mimo! G to L

2
00:00:06,317 --> 00:00:16,044
Mimo: Hi friends! Let's learn more letters! Last time we learned A to F. Today it's G, H, I, J, K and L!

3
00:00:17,644 --> 00:00:21,260
Mimo: Every letter makes a sound. Say them with me!

4
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:27,081
Mimo: This is the letter G! G says guh, guh, guh.

5
00:00:27,381 --> 00:00:28,798
Mimo: Can you say G?

6
00:00:30,698 --> 00:00:34,309
Mimo: G is for grapes! Guh, guh, grapes!

7
00:00:35,913 --> 00:00:38,538
Bruno: Grapes? I love grapes! Can I have some?

8
00:00:42,238 --> 00:00:49,858
Mimo: Next is H! H says hhh, hhh, hhh. Like when you're out of breath!

9
00:00:50,158 --> 00:00:51,759
Mimo: Can you say H?

10
00:00:53,659 --> 00:00:58,181
Mimo: H is for house! Hhh, hhh, house!

11
00:00:58,481 --> 00:01:00,829
Bruno: And H is for... hungry! I'm hungry!

12
00:01:01,129 --> 00:01:03,394
Mimo: Bruno! Of course you are!

13
00:01:05,042 --> 00:01:07,484
Lulu: Hello! Can I help with the next letter?

14
00:01:09,184 --> 00:01:13,373
Mimo: This is the letter I! I says ih, ih, ih.

15
00:01:13,673 --> 00:01:15,103
Mimo: Can you say I?

16
00:01:17,003 --> 00:01:22,085
Lulu: I is for ice cream! Ih, ih, ice cream! Yummy!

17
00:01:23,685 --> 00:01:26,310
Bruno: Ice cream! My favorite letter is I!

18
00:01:28,010 --> 00:01:31,850
Mimo: Here comes J! J says juh, juh, juh.

19
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,618
Mimo: Can you say J?

20
00:01:35,518 --> 00:01:39,189
Mimo: J is for juice! Juh, juh, juice!

21
00:01:39,489 --> 00:01:40,699
Bruno: And J is for jump!

22
00:01:45,235 --> 00:01:47,606
Pip: Wait for me! I love the next letter!

23
00:01:49,306 --> 00:01:53,324
Mimo: This is the letter K! K says kuh, kuh, kuh.

24
00:01:53,624 --> 00:01:54,942
Mimo: Can you say K?

25
00:01:56,842 --> 00:02:00,386
Pip: K is for kite! Kuh, kuh, kite! I love flying kites!

26
00:02:04,086 --> 00:02:09,437
Mimo: And the last letter today is L! L says lll, lll, lll.

27
00:02:09,737 --> 00:02:11,044
Mimo: Can you say L?

28
00:02:12,944 --> 00:02:16,876
Mimo: L is for lion! Lll, lll, lion!

29
00:02:17,176 --> 00:02:18,268
Bruno: ROAR! I'm a lion!

30
00:02:20,168 --> 00:02:23,523
Mimo: Let's say all our letters together! Ready?

31
00:02:23,823 --> 00:02:25,454
Mimo: G, grapes!

32
00:02:26,254 --> 00:02:27,348
Bruno: H, house!

33
00:02:28,148 --> 00:02:30,227
Lulu: I, ice cream!

34
00:02:31,027 --> 00:02:32,237
Bruno: J, juice!

35
00:02:33,037 --> 00:02:34,084
Pip: K, kite!

36
00:02:34,884 --> 00:02:36,288
Mimo: L, lion!

37
00:02:37,888 --> 00:02:42,040
Mimo: Great job, friends! Now you know A all the way to L!

38
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:45,140
Mimo: Bye bye! See you next time!
